UgwJRwUs8gnSuRoUOLl4AaABAg,,False,@juanita624,"This song was released during one of the most depressive times in my life. In a span of months, I lost my grandfather, while living in a foreign country, I couldn't even say goodbye... then I injured my spine, I was almost paralyzed, I couldn't walk nor move. I had to have surgery... I was all alone. And then this song came when I needed it the most... and it literally saved me. So, thank you, Seokjinnie! You'll never know how much this means to me. <3",252,2024-05-08T01:21:21Z,2024-05-08T01:21:21Z
