Ugym-7k7YaqLMnJUWyF4AaABAg,,False,@buckybarnes1940,"Jin, I joined the fandom in December 2022 when you were leaving for the military, I was in my 3rd year of college back then. And now that you're so close to returning back, I'm in my final semester, I have a job in hand and my job training will start in a few days. While waiting for your return, I've grown so much and come so far. I'm a different person now, have gone through a lot of struggles and depressing times in these 1.5 years, lost my beloved grandmother, but my love for you and your music is still the same, I have felt your presence constantly all this time through your songs and wise words. The things you have said from your experience of your struggling days, they've helped me a lot. I am very prone to depression and I have severe anxiety so the future worries me a lot but I know your songs will always be my safe place, they'll always comfort me and soothe my worries. Thank you for always being there for me through your songs Jin!",252,2024-01-31T16:48:36Z,2024-01-31T16:48:36Z
