UgzVqhoU2pCrPpJC6014AaABAg,,False,@seokjinsforehead7482,"WOW, it has been 1 year and one day since he released this. On Dec. 3 at around 11 pm kst, he released this. I was going through a lot that time. I was kinda lost. I felt so detached from my self. I couldn’t release the pain and frustrations that time, not until he released this a few minutes later. I read his message about the song and the lyrics itself and I eventually broke-down. In cried my eyes out and released every single bit of sadness and anxiety. My mind ran from one realization to another. I was relieved. Seokjin and especially this song would always have a special place in my heart. Always. Always. 
To anyone reading this, never lose yourself, loves.
Happy Birthday to our Moon, Kim SeokJin

Edit: A day after their 11th anv. Always coming back to this. Just finished my 3rd year in nursing school. Still hanging on, no longer hurting.",9,2021-12-04T15:30:00Z,2024-06-14T18:25:59Z
