Ugy4gognpWqmVTN54WZ4AaABAg,,False,@pingoofgrayskull7000,"So this monday was the very first the of class since the pandemic started. I was almost dying of stress, so much had happened, i had been diagnosed with a personality disorder and hadnt seen anyone in person for so long. I was scared to death. What if they did not like me anymore? What if they forgot about me? What if the ""me"" under the control pills was too diffrent from their memories? What if i saw people who had hurt me in the past? 

During the first classes i was barely awake, trying to hold back a panic attack. During the break, I went o the bathroom and cried, helpless. Then I got a twitter notification with JIN's photo, very simple. It didnt mean anything, but I just put my headphones and listened to the song until the break was over. I had the strenght to go through the rest of the day. 


Thank you, Kim Seokjin. You saved my life more than you will ever know.",2,2021-08-25T21:58:22Z,2021-08-25T21:58:22Z
