UgzPHTmEhDnM4Ah96nl4AaABAg,,False,@KyokoPhuong,"Hi Jin, today I feel the exact the feeling you feel, I am in my own abyss. I know this dark, empty, endless space, this suffocating felling. I return to this space every while and then, and I know you too. Thank you, for putting your heart out there like this. But I hope not to see you there, you belong to the bright, shinning, colorful world above. Jin, you may think your value is less than others, that you're not enough, that you can't meet the expectations... but no, you showed me that I can walk with my own speed, that it's ok to start late, to step back and let others shine. Sometime running after other people is exhausted, so I stop, breath and look at you, because I know no matter how tired you are, you won't stop trying your best and running forward. Thank you, for your existence, for walking this road for us, and be there for people like me and million others. Thank you!",2,2021-07-27T18:21:56Z,2021-07-27T18:21:56Z
